Its _registered line still said default ON (unset = 5); since lever 13 unset = body 6. Picked onto lane-298/v0132 by lane 298 relaunch-115 from lane 302's 39bf2cade6 (HQ87 10:5x); the sha in the text re-keyed 20aed36bcc -> db540a4c36 (the picked lever-13 default commit).

Origin: lane-302
