+      "_registered": "2026-10-06, lane-302 (Opus 5.5). Route A levers 3+4 (IQ2_S gather shader body). Default ON (GGML_ARIFI_IQ2S_BODY unset = 5) from the flip commit (commit-msg-15). AMENDED 2026-10-10 lane-302 relaunch-66: default ON 2026-10-06..2026-10-10 only; from lever 13 (ece2051b8c) unset = body 6 (vulkan-moe-gather-iq2s-body6-const-grid) and body 5 is the GGML_ARIFI_IQ2S_BODY=5 off-ramp.",
